This is a [[Intel Centrino Advanced-N 6205|Intel Centrino Advanced-N 6205 (62205ANHMW)]] Mini PCIe card on a desktop PCIe x1 adapter card with an antenna.
Model Numbers: *62205ANHMWDTX1G - 802.11a/b/g/n, full height PCI bracket in bulk pack *62205ANHMWDTX1H - 802.11 a/b/g/n, half height PCI bracket in bulk pack *62205ANHMWDTX1 - 802.11 a/b/g/n, full height, half height PCI brackets in retail box
